/Title (All navigation links and buttons must have clear labels and visible hover or focus feedback. The registration form must use appropriate HTML input types and associated labels.  The webpage must have consistent alignment, spacing, colour use and visual hierarchy.  The design must remain readable when browser zoom is increased to 125%.  The CSS file must be logically organised and include comments for major sections.  No visible overlap, clipped text, broken cards or unreadable content is permitted.)
